{
  "public_post": "Important notice: The bread sold this week may be contaminated and could make you ill; please avoid buying any co-op bread until we give further instructions.",
  "coop_message": "The flour batch is contaminated – we must stop sales immediately and decide how to inform the village and handle the situation.",
  "reason": "To protect villagers from getting sick while coordinating an urgent response with the co-op."
}

{
  "public_post": "Reminder: Do NOT eat any co‑op bread today; if you have already consumed it, please seek medical attention and inform the village clinic.",
  "coop_message": "We must issue immediate refunds to all customers, recall any unsold loaves, and schedule an urgent meeting tomorrow to decide on compensation and safety measures.",
  "reason": "To protect villagers' health and coordinate the co‑op's response to the contamination."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: All bread sold yesterday is being recalled. Please return any loaves you have to the co‑op for a full refund. We are working to replace the flour and will resume safe baking as soon as possible. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "Team, we need to set up a refund desk at the co‑op today, collect all returned loaves, and track refunds. Also, source a new safe flour batch and plan a communication schedule for the village. Who can handle refunds and who can coordinate the new flour order?",
  "reason": "To inform residents about the recall and refunds, and to coordinate the co‑op's immediate response."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: All bread sold this week is being recalled. Please keep any loaves you have and do NOT eat them. We are processing full refunds and will provide fresh, safe bread next week. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "We must finalize the refund process (full 1‑coin per loaf) and set a deadline for returns, arrange safe flour for next week, and consider a small compensation for those who got sick; let's assign tasks and draft a public apology.",
  "reason": "Residents need clear safety instructions and refund info, while the co‑op must coordinate the recall and plan future safe sales."
}

{
  "public_post": "Refunds are now being processed – please bring any co‑op loaves to the bakery by tonight for a full 1‑coin refund, and we will have safe, fresh bread available starting tomorrow.",
  "coop_message": "Team, assign Tara to the refund desk (collect loaves and issue 1‑coin refunds) and Hana to source the new flour batch; set the refund deadline for tonight 8 PM and confirm we’ll resume sales tomorrow morning.",
  "reason": "We need to complete refunds quickly and restore trust so sales can resume next week."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: Refunds for all loaves sold this week have been processed; please collect your refunds at the co‑op desk today. New safe flour will arrive tomorrow, and we plan to resume baking fresh bread on day 5. Until then, do NOT eat any co‑op bread.",
  "coop_message": "Team, the refund desk is open today; ensure every resident receives their 1‑coin per loaf. I have secured a new certified flour batch arriving tomorrow morning; Hana, please oversee the quality check and start baking on day 5. Quin, draft a compensation offer (e.g., a free loaf) for those who fell ill and prepare a brief apology. Please vote on the proposed timeline.",
  "reason": "To finalize refunds, inform villagers, and coordinate a safe resumption of bread sales."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: All refunds have been issued. New certified flour has arrived and will be quality‑checked today. Fresh, safe co‑op bread will be back on sale starting tomorrow (day 5). Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "Zoe, please confirm the new flour batch has arrived and conduct the quality check today; Hana, oversee the check and give the go‑ahead for baking on day 5; Quin, finalize the compensation plan (free loaf for those who fell ill) and draft the public apology; Tara will close the refund desk and update inventory. Please vote on the timeline to resume sales on day 5.",
  "reason": "Villagers need clear info on when safe bread returns, and the co‑op must finalize safety checks, compensation, and sales timing."
}

{
  "public_post": "Apology to the village: we are deeply sorry for the recent illness caused by contaminated flour. All refunds have been processed. Fresh, safe bread is now back on sale starting today. As a token of thanks, anyone who fell ill will receive a free loaf on their next purchase. Thank you for your patience and trust.",
  "coop_message": "Team, the new certified flour batch arrived this morning and has passed quality checks. Begin baking immediately so fresh loaves are ready for sale today. Quin, please finalize the compensation offer (free loaf for anyone who got sick) and draft the full public apology text; share it here for approval before posting. Zoe, coordinate distribution of the free loaves. Let’s ensure a smooth restart.",
  "reason": "Announce safe bread resumption, apologize, and introduce compensation while coordinating final steps within the co‑op."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: All refunds have been processed and the new certified flour batch arrived this morning. Fresh, safe bread will be back on sale tomorrow (day 5). As an apology, any resident who fell ill will receive a free loaf on their next purchase. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "Team, refunds are now fully completed and the new flour is in the bakery. We'll begin baking on day 5 and resume sales tomorrow. Please confirm the list of residents who reported illness (clinic noted 1, but check for others) and approve a compensation voucher: one free loaf per affected resident. Also, finalize the apology statement for tomorrow's board post. Vote on the compensation plan (Yes/No).",
  "reason": "To inform villagers that sales will resume with safe bread and offer compensation, and to coordinate final refund closure and compensation approval within the co‑op."
}

{
  "public_post": "Update: Safe flour arrived today and we are preparing fresh bread. Sales will resume tomorrow (Day 5). All refunds have been issued; please collect any outstanding refunds at the desk today. As a token of apology, anyone who fell ill will receive a free loaf with their next purchase.",
  "coop_message": "Team, the new certified flour batch is here and will be quality‑checked today; we’ll start baking on Day 5 and open sales then. Please confirm who will distribute the complimentary loaf to affected residents and ensure the refund desk closes by end of day. Vote to approve this timeline if you haven’t already.",
  "reason": "We need to inform villagers of the safe resumption of sales and handle compensation, while coordinating final prep and distribution tasks within the co‑op."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news! Fresh, safe co‑op bread is back on sale starting today (Day 5). Thank you for your patience. As promised, any resident who fell ill will receive a free loaf with their next purchase. Please let us know if you have any concerns.",
  "coop_message": "Team, the new certified flour batch passed quality checks and baking began this morning; inventory is ready for Day 5 sales. Compensation plan (free loaf for each ill resident) has been approved. Refund desk is closed. Let's monitor sales and any feedback closely.",
  "reason": "Announce resumption of sales and confirm co‑op tasks."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news! Fresh, safe bread is back on sale today (Day 5). All refunds have been issued and the new certified flour has passed quality checks. As a thank‑you, anyone who fell ill will receive a free loaf with their next purchase. Thank you for your patience and trust.",
  "coop_message": "Team, today we open sales with the new batch. Tara, keep the refund desk closed. Zoe, distribute the complimentary loaf vouchers to the resident(s) who reported illness (verify with the clinic). Quin, monitor sales and any feedback; if any issues arise, halt immediately. Let's ensure a smooth restart.",
  "reason": "Announce safe bread and compensation publicly while coordinating the rollout internally."
}

{
  "public_post": "Fresh, safe bread is back on sale today (Day 5). Thank you for your patience. As promised, anyone who fell ill will receive a free loaf with their next purchase. We apologize for the inconvenience and look forward to serving you.",
  "coop_message": "All refunds are completed, the new certified flour has been baked, and sales resume today. Please confirm the list of residents who reported illness (clinic noted 1, verify if any others) and approve the compensation vouchers (one free loaf per affected resident). Tara, close the refund desk; Zoe, coordinate distribution of the free loaves; let me know if any issues arise.",
  "reason": "Announce the restart of sales and the compensation offer publicly, and finalize coordination and verification tasks within the co‑op."
}

{
  "public_post": "Thank you for your patience, villagers – fresh, safe co‑op bread will remain available daily, and anyone who fell ill will receive their complimentary loaf; please let us know of any concerns or symptoms.",
  "coop_message": "All compensation vouchers have been distributed and the refund desk is closed; continue monitoring sales and health reports today, and if any new issues arise, halt sales immediately and report to the team.",
  "reason": "To reassure villagers and coordinate final follow‑up actions."
}

{
  "public_post": "Day 6: Fresh, safe co‑op bread is available today – thank you for your patience. If you fell ill from earlier batches, remember to collect your complimentary loaf at the bakery; we are closely monitoring health reports and will act if needed.",
  "coop_message": "All sales continue today; please monitor the clinic reports and be ready to halt sales and issue refunds if any new illness is linked to today’s bread.",
  "reason": "We reassure villagers that bread is safe and remind ill residents to claim compensation while urging the team to watch for new health issues."
}

{
  "public_post": "Day 6: Fresh, safe co‑op bread is back on sale today. Thank you for your patience – as promised, anyone who fell ill receives a free loaf with their purchase. Please let us know if you have any concerns.",
  "coop_message": "Sales are ongoing today. The clinic reported 2 residents ill; we’ll keep a close eye on any symptoms. If you hear of additional cases, report them immediately. Remember to hand out the complimentary loaf vouchers to the affected resident(s) and monitor feedback. Let’s ensure a smooth day.",
  "reason": "to reassure villagers and keep the co‑op informed while monitoring health reports"
}
